    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the onsen house  beyond the eyes of the living.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Yokai Onsen</i></strong> is a cozy idle onsen management game that sits at the side of your screen. When the human world sleeps, weary yokai and spirits visit your bathhouse to cleanse their burdens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Aki, a mysterious onsen house owner, and manage the onsen with your spirit companion Ku. Greet yokai guests, renovate rooms, earn gold, and grow your steamy business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Supernatural Bathhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle incoming guests, assign them to baths, clean up after their soak, and keep the hot spring running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy themed baths, lanterns, and decor to make your bathhouse unique\u2014and boost your profits along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Mysterious Yokai Guests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni, Spirit, Bakemono... Each yokai has its own traits and backstory\u2014discover who they are as they pass through your doors\u00a0and uncover the secrets of your bathhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automate with Shikigami Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon loyal shikigami to run your bathhouse while you relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mystical helpers will greet guests, keep the place tidy, and collect income\u2014even while you\u2019re away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the onsen house  beyond the eyes of the living.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Yokai Onsen</i></strong> is a cozy idle onsen management game that sits at the side of your screen. When the human world sleeps, weary yokai and spirits visit your bathhouse to cleanse their burdens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of Aki, a mysterious onsen house owner, and manage the onsen with your spirit companion Ku. Greet yokai guests, renovate rooms, earn gold, and grow your steamy business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Supernatural Bathhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle incoming guests, assign them to baths, clean up after their soak, and keep the hot spring running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/4bfc322c792ee9b06ab391c660e85db1.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate and Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy themed baths, lanterns, and decor to make your bathhouse unique\u2014and boost your profits along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/f68118a0214e4d22ca036c93dde276c0.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Mysterious Yokai Guests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oni, Spirit, Bakemono... Each yokai has its own traits and backstory\u2014discover who they are as they pass through your doors\u00a0and uncover the secrets of your bathhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/0ac1984bcabe646d1ae27e63ac8728e1.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automate with Shikigami Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon loyal shikigami to run your bathhouse while you relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mystical helpers will greet guests, keep the place tidy, and collect income\u2014even while you\u2019re away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.poster.avif?t=1748573707\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.webm?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685940/extras/de5a37855b88e3015d62fdc50e473e37.mp4?t=1748573707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
